@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam arrowColor #3b82f6
skinparam arrowThickness 2

title 解密速度优化路径 (193s -> 3.4s -> 4.3s streaming)

|#fecaca| Phase 0: 原始 Go 实现
start
#fecaca:逐样本同步 TCP
send(4B) -> send(data) -> recv(data)
4346 samples x 44ms/sample = **193s**
0.3 MB/s;
note right #fffbeb
  **根因**: Nagle 算法
  每个 4B 长度头被延迟 40ms
end note

|#fefce8| Phase 1: TCP_NODELAY
#fefce8:设置 TCP_NODELAY
禁用 Nagle 算法
socket buffer 256KB;
#16a34a:结果: **3.72s** (52x);

|#dcfce7| Phase 2: TCP 管线化
#dcfce7:writer/reader 双线程分离
bounded semaphore (depth=64)
发送不等接收;
#16a34a:结果: **3.40s** (57x)
18.1 MB/s;

|#e0e7ff| Phase 3: 连接复用
#e0e7ff:PersistentDecryptSession
一个 TCP 连接跨多首歌
省去 key context 重建 ~0.8s;

|#f3e8ff| Phase 4: 预取管线
#f3e8ff:ThreadPoolExecutor prefetch
解密当前歌时下载下一首
download + decrypt 重叠;

|#dcfce7| Phase 5: 流式 BMFF
#dcfce7:streaming_bmff.py
边下载边解析边解密
从不在内存中持有完整 M4S;
#16a34a:结果: **4.3s** (45x)
内存 181 MB -> **11 MB** (94% 下降);

|#fecaca| Phase 6: 白盒攻击尝试
#fecaca:DFA fault injection (600 次)
全内存 S-box/T-table 扫描
GDB 断点 AES_cbc_encrypt;
note right #fecaca
  **结论**: libCoreFP.so
  = 第三代白盒 AES
  无 T-table, DFA/DCA 不可用
  18 MB/s 是硬上限
end note

stop

@enduml
